# Only this build lists the dev-only reference module `example` in the library (the module tests need it); release and Dev-Preview builds never do (`includeDevOnly` in core/modules/registry.ts). Its manifest is still bundled everywhere: the table stays in the schema.
VITE_INCLUDE_EXAMPLE=true
# The default set of a fresh installation (lists, budgets, downloads: core/modules/defaults.ts) stays off in the test builds: every fresh test context would otherwise be a new installation with three more modules. `e2e/seed/defaults.seed.spec.ts` switches it on for its own context.
VITE_DEFAULTS_OFF=1
